                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Eight tabs lead a plate in with a 30° slope. The slope starts 3 mm above the seat, so a nominal plate landing up to 2.0 mm off centre still finds the pocket.",
